### Authorization code request (GET)
GET {{base}}/oauth/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{client_id}}&redirect_uri={{redirect_uri}}&scope={{scopes}}&state={{state}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### Authorization code request (POST)
POST {{base}}/oauth/authorize HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

response_type=code&client_id={{client_id}}&redirect_uri={{redirect_uri}}&scope={{scopes}}&state={{state}}

### Simulate user giving consent
GET {{base}}/oauth/authorize?response_type=code&client_id={{client_id}}&redirect_uri={{redirect_uri}}&scope={{scopes}}&state={{state}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Get access token with the code
POST {{base}}/oauth/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code={{auth_code}}&client_id={{client_id}}&redirect_uri={{redirect_uri}}&state={{state}}
